meta {
  name: Users - Me
  type: http
  seq: 61
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/user
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The signed-in user (#1145): cuid, name, username, email, email_verified_at, two_factor_enabled and the profile. The profile holds every field of the member, also the hidden ones: the headline (#1688, one line of plain text, an empty text when there is none), the bio, the location, the phone and the links, and field_visibility, the choice of the member for each of these fields (ADR 0020). Other members never get the account fields of a user.
}
